# MemoryBox product context

Couple journal app (SwiftUI + Core Data + CloudKit). Tabs: Home, Kỷ niệm, Tin nhắn, Ngày đặc biệt.

## Before coding share/onboarding

Read `docs/onboarding-couple-share-flow.md` and follow it.

## Architecture defaults

- Target: **View + ViewModel + Service**, not fat Views.
- Vietnamese UI copy. Keep existing romantic visual language (`AnimatedLoveBackdrop`, pink tint).
- Appearance: app-controlled light/dark via `AppAppearance`, not system-only.
- Karpathy guidelines still apply: small diffs, no speculative features.

## Do not

- Don't commit xcuserdata / `.DS_Store`.
- Don't force-push unless the user explicitly asks.
- Don't expand CloudKit schema casually; extend carefully and document.
